              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ecclesiastes 10:8",
        "book": "Ecclesiastes",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Whoso removeth stones shall be hurt therewith; and he that cleaveth wood shall be endangered thereby.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 50
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ecclesiastes 10:9",
        "book": "Ecclesiastes",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "If the iron be blunt, and he do not whet the edge, then must he put to more strength: but wisdom is profitable to direct.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 97,
            "end": 99
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ecclesiastes 10:10",
        "book": "Ecclesiastes",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Surely the serpent will bite without enchantment; and a babbler is no better.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ecclesiastes 10:11",
        "book": "Ecclesiastes",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "The words of a wise man’s mouth are gracious; but the lips of a fool will swallow up himself.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 9,
            "text": "Prov. 10:32."
          },
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 68,
            "text": "2 Ne. 9:28 (28–29); 19:17; D&C 35:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 35
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Prov. 10:32.",
            "prettyString": "Proverbs 10:32",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "proverbs",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 10,
